# sha256 of every version of the shipped Klipper config files an image has carried
# (rootfs/board/kobra_s1/klipper_config, mainsail.cfg from mainsail-config). An old copy
# in printer_data/config with one of these sums is unmodified, so kobra-config-migrate can
# replace it with the image's file. Add the new sum whenever one of the files changes
# (CI and post-build.sh check that the current ones are listed); never remove a
# line of a version that was shipped.
